B.a4M=new A.c("This project involved creating a preseed file that contained predefined users and passwords. The preseed file was integrated into a Debian ISO image, enabling automated installations. During the installation process, the preseed option was selected in GRUB, and keystrokes were sent using the Proxmox API to initiate the installation seamlessly. After the installation was complete, additional configuration tasks were automated using Ansible, which logged in using the root account to perform these tasks efficiently.",null,B.B,null,null,null,null,null,null)
