B.a5C=new A.c("During my college days, I used Selenium primarily for testing purposes rather than automating tasks. I explored its capabilities by simulating workflows like assignment submissions to understand how it could be used effectively. While I didn\u2019t automate anything, the experience of testing with Selenium gave me insights into its potential for streamlining processes. I even imagined creating a script that would generate my assignment PDFs using LaTeX and automatically submit them as soon as the portal updated. Although this idea remains unimplemented, it reflects the possibilities Selenium offers.",null,B.B,null,null,null,null,null,null)
